# Web frontend

## Router & data

- File routes in `apps/web/src/routes/`. Do not edit `routeTree.gen.ts`.
- **Fast Refresh:** route modules export only the TanStack `Route` (loaders, `beforeLoad`, `component` references). Put page and layout UI in `apps/web/src/components/` — e.g. `components/pages/`, `components/layout/`, `components/auth/`. Use `getRouteApi(...)` in components when you need parent route context; do not import `Route` from a route file into a component.
- Product routes: `/login` (Google-only), `/` (upcoming events + library), `/meetings/$id` (Ongoing | Recording tabs), `/share/$shareSlug` (public, no auth).
- Root route provides `queryClient` context (`__root.tsx`).
- Prefetch in route `loader` with `queryClient.ensureQueryData(xxxQueryOptions())`; read data with hooks from `@repo/api-client`.
- Honor `@tanstack/router/create-route-property-order` (oxlint).
- Auth client: `better-auth/react` (or `/client`) against `/api/auth`. Connect Calendar = `linkSocial` extra Google Calendar scopes.

## Product UX (Fathom slice)

- **List first**, then ongoing call, then **playback as the polish target** (video + synced transcript + summary + timestamped action items + highlight markers + share). Q&A last.
- Ongoing: map `baasStatus` with the shared contract mapper. Honest labels (`Starting soon`, `Joining…`, `In call — recording`, `Call ended, processing…`). Poll ~5–10s while joining, ~60s in call. Never a generic spinner across transitions. Failures immediately. Elapsed time, not live transcript. Highlight = POST `{ timestampSec, note? }`. Scratchpad = upsert `ScratchpadEntry` at `{ timestampSec, text }` (debounced).
- No manual start-capture control. Semantic tokens only (see Theming).

## API wiring

- Configure HTTP client in `apps/web` (`configureApiClient` in `main.tsx`).
- Env: `apps/web/src/env.ts` with Zod + `import.meta.env` (`VITE_*`).

## UI (`@repo/ui-web`)

- shadcn-style components with Tailwind 4, `cn()` from `#lib/utils`, CVA variants where used.
- Add new shared components here; app-specific pieces stay in `apps/web`.
- Global theme/CSS: `@repo/ui-web/globals.css` (`packages/ui-web/src/styles/globals.css`).

## Theming (strict)

- **Only semantic theme utilities** from `globals.css` (`@theme inline` + `:root` / `.dark`): e.g. `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `bg-primary`, `text-primary-foreground`, `bg-muted`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, `ring-ring`, `bg-card`, `bg-destructive`, sidebar/chart tokens, `rounded-lg` / radius scale.
- **Never** ad-hoc Tailwind: no default palette (`text-gray-500`, `bg-blue-600`), no arbitrary colors (`bg-[#…]`, `text-[oklch(...)]`), no one-off hex/rgb in classNames.
- Need a new color or radius? **Extend `globals.css`** (CSS variables + `@theme`), then use the new token class — do not hardcode in JSX.
- Prefer existing `@repo/ui-web` components and their variants before custom styled markup.

## Imports

- App aliases: `#src/*`, `#lib/*`, `#components/*`, `#hooks/*`.
- React 19 + React Compiler; functional components only.
